{"name": "Blackjack Wars", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A fast-paced and dynamic blackjack experience, set against dark-themed tables and adorned with epic hero battles!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the heat of a tie, fate is decided by a coin toss. Each round offers unique combinations, and with just three intense turns, every match becomes a thrilling clash of wits and luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras_big/dc3a65dbb45289d472540f9f1e37163a.avif?t=1761140666\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/dc3a65dbb45289d472540f9f1e37163a.avif?t=1761140666\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Feel the power in every strike!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With distinct classes, custom effects, and immersive sound design, every move places you right in the heart of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/49030d758a0529ecaebf86e81d4dc591.poster.avif?t=1761140666\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/49030d758a0529ecaebf86e81d4dc591.webm?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/49030d758a0529ecaebf86e81d4dc591.mp4?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character reflects a unique playstyle, and the rhythm of combat shifts accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras_big/fe3cb05aa096d011ad42dc04695e4e1d.avif?t=1761140666\" height=\"100\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/fe3cb05aa096d011ad42dc04695e4e1d.avif?t=1761140666\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A unique atmosphere shaped by dark-themed tables that evolve as you level up!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, the ambiance transforms, and each level introduces a new table with its own dark and immersive theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/62fc7d2d11314a1458c250c55c748bc8.poster.avif?t=1761140666\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/62fc7d2d11314a1458c250c55c748bc8.webm?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/62fc7d2d11314a1458c250c55c748bc8.mp4?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every stage opens the door to a deeper, more mysterious, and more captivating experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras_big/b497698dc0239a02ac716406a7424723.avif?t=1761140666\" height=\"194\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/b497698dc0239a02ac716406a7424723.avif?t=1761140666\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Change the course of battle with powerful abilities!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 13 abilities, the right moves can swing the table\u2019s advantage in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"480\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/71404121aa916550a962dec28d17be8e.poster.avif?t=1761140666\" width=\"854\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/71404121aa916550a962dec28d17be8e.webm?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/extras/71404121aa916550a962dec28d17be8e.mp4?t=1761140666\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, you must demonstrate the resolve to pick the ability according to the revealed cards.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A fast-paced, dynamic, and extraordinary blackjack experience set on dark-themed tables, blended with epic hero battles! With fate decided by coin tosses, four-round short matches, special abilities and diverse table combinations, prepare for breathless battles where wit and luck collide.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694020/923d1fae1cd6bc96f191b69506b3f8336a2cad30/header.jpg?t=1761140666", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Singleplayer", "Casual", "Card Battler", "Card Game", "Gambling"], "developers": "Process Games", "publishers": "Process Games", "release_date": "Oct 22, 2025", "price": "$6.99", "appid": "3694020", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "11 July 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/b_-oFuZHyH4", "first_seen": 1752184800.0, "review_rank": 1560}